    "prompt": "In an alien language, ***jalez borg farn*** means \\\"good maths skills\\\". ***Nurf klar borg*** means \\\"maths in harmony\\\" and ***darko klar farn*** means \\\"good in gold\\\". What is \\\"harmony gold\\\" in this language?",
