    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Find common words",
        "body": "Sentences 1 and 2 share only 'maths', and the common word is *borg*. Sentences 1 and 3 share only 'good', common word *farn*. Sentences 2 and 3 share only 'in', common word *klar*.\n\nSo *jalez* = skills, *nurf* = harmony, *darko* = gold. \"Harmony gold\" is *nurf darko*, i.e. *darko nurf* (only choice D contains these two words).\n\n**Answer: (D) darko nurf**"
