    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "In the table each letter of the alphabet is given a value. The algebraic expression $4x-3$ is used as a key to convert the letters P S R X B O E into the word H A R M O N Y. Which one of the following keys is used to convert S R X B into G O L D?",
