        "key": "E",
        "text": "$\\pi$"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Three segments",
        "body": "Each shaded region is a circular segment: a sector of radius $2$ and angle $60^\\circ$ with the equilateral triangle on its chord (a side of $\\triangle ABC$) removed.\n\nSector area $=\\frac16\\pi\\cdot2^2=\\frac{2\\pi}3$. Equilateral triangle of side $2$ has area $\\frac{\\sqrt3}4\\cdot4=\\sqrt3$. A segment has area $\\frac{2\\pi}3-\\sqrt3$.\n\nThree segments: $2\\pi-3\\sqrt3$.\n\n**Answer: (A) $2\\pi-3\\sqrt3$**"
      }
