        "title": "Test each suspect",
        "body": "Count how many statements are true for each possible culprit; we need exactly $2$.\n\n- Amelia broke it: Amelia true, Bongani true, Charles false, Devine true, Edwina false: $3$ true. No.\n- Bongani: Amelia true, Bongani false, Charles false, Devine false, Edwina false: $1$ true. No.\n- Charles: Amelia false, Bongani true, Charles false, Devine false, Edwina true: $2$ true. Yes.\n- Devine: Amelia false, Bongani false, Charles false, Devine false, Edwina false: $0$ true. No.\n- Edwina: Amelia true, Bongani true, Charles true, Devine true, Edwina false: $4$ true. No.\n\nCharles broke the window.\n\n**Answer: (C) Charles**"
